<p>Lay a trap that creates a radius 5 gravitic anomaly when triggered by foes approaching within range 1.  Each turn, the anomaly deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">73, 85, 95, 103, 110</acronym> temporal damage (based on your Magic) to foes while pulling them towards its center (chance increases with your combat accuracy or spell power, whichever is higher).</p><p>Each anomaly lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns (up to the amount of time since the last anomaly dissipated, based on your Trap Mastery skill).</p><p>The trap may trigger more than once, but requires at least 2 turns to recharge between activations.</p><p>This design does not require advanced preparation to use.</p>